					PRINTFORML 「Looks like she's still enjoying herself.」
					PRINTFORML 「...」
					PRINTFORML 「If I put some ice down her back right now, she'd jump out of bed frightened...」
					PRINTFORML 「Since I thought of that, I gotta go through with it!」
					PRINTFORML 「So if I make it around this big... ...Hm?」
					CALL COLORMESSAGE14(@"　Mm, Mmnh...",C_GREEN,1,0)
					PRINTFORMW 「Ack, she's gonna wake up!!」
					CALL COLORMESSAGE14(@"　Mhー ...I slept well. ...Huh? What's wrong, Cirno-chan?",C_GREEN,1,0)
